<title>CANADA: Canada's Prairies to see sunny, warm weather.</title>
<headline>Canada's Prairies to see sunny, warm weather.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canada's Prairies on Friday were forecast to see sunny, warm weather, Environment Canada said.</p>
<p>Alberta should see sun with highs of 25 to 28 Celsius.</p>
<p>Saskatchewan should see sun with a high of 28 Celsius.</p>
<p>Manitoba should see sun with highs of 12 to 20 Celsius.</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548))</p>
